{"seq":3,"slug":"anr-freeze-detection","title":"ANR 与卡顿检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/anr-freeze-detection","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"anr-与卡顿检测\">ANR 与卡顿检测</h1><p>应用没有崩溃，但主线程被阻塞了 5 秒以上——Android 系统弹出&quot;应用无响应&quot;对话框（ANR），iOS 上用户看到界面完全冻结。这类问题比崩溃更隐蔽、更难诊断：用户感知到的是&quot;卡&quot;，但没有明确的错误信号。Google Play Vitals 将 ANR-free rate &lt; 99.5% 标记为不良体验，其影响等同于高崩溃率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ANR（Application Not Responding）和 App Hang 的共同本质是<strong>主线程阻塞</strong>——UI 事件循环无法在系统规定的时间窗口内完成一次调度周期。检测方法分为两类：主动探测（Watchdog 线程定时检查主线程响应）和被动记录（系统 API 事后提供确认的 ANR 事件）。后者精确但有延迟，前者实时但存在误报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"android-anr-机制与检测\">Android ANR 机制与检测</h2><p>Android 系统定义了明确的 ANR 触发条件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ANR 类型</th>\n<th>超时时间</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Input dispatching</td>\n<td>5 秒</td>\n<td>主线程未在 5s 内处理输入事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BroadcastReceiver</td>\n<td>前台 10s / 后台 60s</td>\n<td>onReceive 执行超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td>前台 20s / 后台 200s</td>\n<td>onCreate/onStartCommand 超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ContentProvider</td>\n<td>10 秒</td>\n<td>publish timeout</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当 ANR 发生时，system_server 记录所有线程的堆栈快照到 <code>/data/anr/traces.txt</code>（设备端调试用）。但生产环境中，开发者需要通过 SDK 来采集这些数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sentry-anr-检测的两代实现\">Sentry ANR 检测的两代实现</h3><p>Sentry Android SDK 提供了两种 ANR 检测实现，根据系统版本自动切换：</p>\n<p><strong>Watchdog 方式（v1，Android &lt; 11）</strong>：SDK 启动一个后台线程，每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{check}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（默认 5s）向主线程 Handler 投递一个心跳 Runnable。如果 Runnable 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>timeout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{timeout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timeout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内未被执行，判定为 ANR 并抓取当前所有线程的堆栈：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ANR detected</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last_heartbeat</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>timeout</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ANR detected} \\iff t_{\\text{now}} - t_{\\text{last\\_heartbeat}} &gt; T_{\\text{timeout}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ANR detected</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last_heartbeat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">timeout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该方式的缺陷是<strong>误报率高</strong>——设备 CPU 负载高时正常的调度延迟也可能触发假 ANR。</p>\n<p><strong>ApplicationExitInfo 方式（v2，Android 11+）</strong>：读取系统 API <code>ActivityManager.getHistoricalProcessExitReasons()</code>，获取系统记录的真实 ANR 事件。这与 Google Play Console 使用相同数据源，确保 SDK 上报的 ANR 率与 Play Vitals 一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"SentryAndroid.init(context) { options -&gt;&#10;    options.isAnrEnabled = true  // 控制两种实现的总开关&#10;    options.isReportHistoricalAnrs = true  // v2: 上报历史 ANR&#10;    options.isAttachAnrThreadDump = true   // 附带完整线程 dump&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SentryAndroid.init(context) { options -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    options.isAnrEnabled = true  // 控制两种实现的总开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    options.isReportHistoricalAnrs = true  // v2: 上报历史 ANR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    options.isAttachAnrThreadDump = true   // 附带完整线程 dump</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>v2 的优势：无假阳性（系统确认的 ANR）、携带完整线程 dump（含锁信息）、与 Play Console 数据对齐。局限：只在下次启动时才能获取数据，且只有最新一条 ANR 能被完整 enrich（breadcrumbs、tags、contexts）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-app-hang-检测\">iOS App Hang 检测</h2><p>iOS 没有 &quot;ANR&quot; 概念，但有等价问题——App Hang（应用挂起）。当主线程持续无响应超过一定时间，用户感知到 UI 冻结。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[主线程事件循环] --&gt; B{RunLoop 活跃?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[正常响应]&#10;    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;250ms| D[Slow Frame]&#10;    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;700ms| E[Frozen Frame]&#10;    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;2s| F[App Hang&lt;br/&gt;上报事件]&#10;    F --&gt; G[抓取主线程堆栈]&#10;    G --&gt; H[记录 hang duration]&#10;    H --&gt; I[恢复后上报]\">flowchart TD\n    A[主线程事件循环] --&gt; B{RunLoop 活跃?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[正常响应]\n    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;250ms| D[Slow Frame]\n    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;700ms| E[Frozen Frame]\n    B --&gt;|否,持续&gt;2s| F[App Hang&lt;br/&gt;上报事件]\n    F --&gt; G[抓取主线程堆栈]\n    G --&gt; H[记录 hang duration]\n    H --&gt; I[恢复后上报]</pre><p>Sentry iOS SDK 的 App Hang 检测基于 CFRunLoop observer：在主线程 RunLoop 的 <code>beforeWaiting</code> 和 <code>afterWaiting</code> 之间计时。当耗时超过阈值（默认 2s，可配置）时认定为 hang：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"SentrySDK.start { options in&#10;    options.enableAppHangTracking = true&#10;    options.appHangTimeoutInterval = 2.0  // 秒&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SentrySDK.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { options </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.enableAppHangTracking </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.appHangTimeoutInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Apple 自身通过 MetricKit 的 <code>MXHangDiagnostic</code>（iOS 14+）提供 hang 诊断数据，但存在 24 小时延迟（iOS 15+ 改善）。Xcode Organizer 中的&quot;Hangs&quot;面板展示按严重程度分类的 hang 报告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡顿度量体系\">卡顿度量体系</h2><p>卡顿（Jank/Stutter）是比 ANR/Hang 更细粒度的问题——用户感知到界面不流畅但未触及 ANR 阈值。度量依赖帧渲染时间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>对用户的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Normal Frame</td>\n<td>渲染耗时 ≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>16.67</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1000}{60} \\approx 16.67\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.67</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> (60fps)</td>\n<td>流畅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slow Frame</td>\n<td>渲染耗时 &gt; 16.67ms 但 &lt; 700ms</td>\n<td>轻微卡顿感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frozen Frame</td>\n<td>渲染耗时 ≥ 700ms</td>\n<td>明显冻结</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>帧率稳定性用百分位数衡量比平均值更有意义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Jank Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Slow Frames</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Frozen Frames</mtext></mrow><mtext>Total Frames</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Jank Rate} = \\frac{\\text{Slow Frames} + \\text{Frozen Frames}}{\\text{Total Frames}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Jank Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Frames</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Slow Frames</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Frozen Frames</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Sentry 和 Firebase 都提供 Slow/Frozen frame 的自动采集。Android 通过 <code>FrameMetrics</code> API（API 24+）获取每帧渲染时间，iOS 通过 <code>CADisplayLink</code> 计算帧间隔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主线程阻塞的典型根因\">主线程阻塞的典型根因</h2><p>ANR/Hang 的根因几乎总是主线程被阻塞。常见模式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>主线程同步 I/O</strong>：数据库查询、文件读写、网络请求（最常见）</li>\n<li><strong>锁竞争</strong>：主线程等待后台线程持有的锁</li>\n<li><strong>大量计算</strong>：在主线程上执行排序、序列化、图片解码</li>\n<li><strong>死锁</strong>：两个线程互相等待对方释放资源</li>\n<li><strong>系统 API 阻塞</strong>：某些 ContentProvider 查询、SharedPreferences <code>commit()</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>诊断工具需要能回答&quot;主线程在等什么&quot;。线程 dump 中的锁信息是关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;main&quot; tid=1 Blocked&#10;  - waiting to lock &lt;0x12345678&gt; held by thread &quot;AsyncTask #3&quot;&#10;  at com.myapp.db.DatabaseHelper.querySync (DatabaseHelper.java:42)&#10;  at com.myapp.ui.HomeActivity.onResume (HomeActivity.java:87)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"main\" tid=1 Blocked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - waiting to lock &#x3C;0x12345678> held by thread \"AsyncTask #3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  at com.myapp.db.DatabaseHelper.querySync (DatabaseHelper.java:42)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  at com.myapp.ui.HomeActivity.onResume (HomeActivity.java:87)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这清楚地表明：主线程在 <code>onResume</code> 中同步调用了数据库查询，而数据库锁被后台线程持有。修复方向是将查询移到协程/后台线程，结果通过回调传回主线程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"anr-率优化策略\">ANR 率优化策略</h2><p>将 ANR-free rate 从 98% 提升到 99.5% 以上的系统性方法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[ANR 报告收集] --&gt; B[按 blocking call 分组]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Top 5 根因排序]&#10;    C --&gt; D{根因类型}&#10;    D --&gt;|同步 I/O| E[迁移到后台线程&lt;br/&gt;+ 异步回调]&#10;    D --&gt;|锁竞争| F[缩小锁粒度&lt;br/&gt;或无锁设计]&#10;    D --&gt;|大量计算| G[分片到多帧&lt;br/&gt;或移到后台]&#10;    D --&gt;|系统 API| H[使用异步替代&lt;br/&gt;如 apply vs commit]&#10;    E --&gt; I[灰度验证]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[ANR 率回归测试]&#10;    J --&gt; K{达标?}&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[全量发布]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| C\">flowchart TD\n    A[ANR 报告收集] --&gt; B[按 blocking call 分组]\n    B --&gt; C[Top 5 根因排序]\n    C --&gt; D{根因类型}\n    D --&gt;|同步 I/O| E[迁移到后台线程&lt;br/&gt;+ 异步回调]\n    D --&gt;|锁竞争| F[缩小锁粒度&lt;br/&gt;或无锁设计]\n    D --&gt;|大量计算| G[分片到多帧&lt;br/&gt;或移到后台]\n    D --&gt;|系统 API| H[使用异步替代&lt;br/&gt;如 apply vs commit]\n    E --&gt; I[灰度验证]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[ANR 率回归测试]\n    J --&gt; K{达标?}\n    K --&gt;|是| L[全量发布]\n    K --&gt;|否| C</pre><p>关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SharedPreferences</strong>：用 <code>apply()</code> 替代 <code>commit()</code>，前者异步写盘</li>\n<li><strong>数据库操作</strong>：Room 默认禁止主线程查询，强制使用 suspend 函数</li>\n<li><strong>图片加载</strong>：确保 decode 在后台线程（Glide/Coil 默认处理）</li>\n<li><strong>ContentProvider</strong>：避免在 <code>onCreate</code> 中做重量级初始化（App Startup 库解耦）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ANR 与 Hang 的监控数据需要与<a href=\"crash-reporting-systems\">崩溃上报体系</a>的 crash-free rate 联合看——两者共同定义了应用的稳定性基线。同时，启动阶段的卡顿问题通常需要专门的<a href=\"../performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics\">启动性能度量</a>来精细诊断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ANR 和 App Hang 是比崩溃更隐蔽但影响同样严重的稳定性问题。Android 11+ 的 ApplicationExitInfo API 提供了与 Google Play Console 一致的 ANR 数据源；iOS 的 App Hang 检测依赖 RunLoop observer 计时。卡顿度量以 Slow/Frozen Frame 率为核心指标。治理的关键在于系统性地将主线程同步操作迁移到后台——SharedPreferences 的 apply vs commit、数据库查询的异步化、图片解码的后台线程化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ANR 与卡顿检测","id":"anr-与卡顿检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Android ANR 机制与检测","id":"android-anr-机制与检测"},{"level":3,"text":"Sentry ANR 检测的两代实现","id":"sentry-anr-检测的两代实现"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS App Hang 检测","id":"ios-app-hang-检测"},{"level":2,"text":"卡顿度量体系","id":"卡顿度量体系"},{"level":2,"text":"主线程阻塞的典型根因","id":"主线程阻塞的典型根因"},{"level":2,"text":"ANR 率优化策略","id":"anr-率优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"符号化与反混淆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/crash-stability/symbolication-deobfuscation"},"next":{"title":"启动性能度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/app-launch-metrics"}}